 *
 * Token reference:
 *   --bg-primary:     #F5F5F5   (window background)
 *   --bg-secondary:   #FFFFFF   (card / groupbox background)
 *   --bg-canvas:      #FAFAFA   (canvas drawing area)
 *   --accent-primary: #1565C0   (buttons, selection highlights)
 *   --accent-hover:   #1976D2   (hover states)
 *   --text-primary:   #1A1A1A   (primary readable text)
 *   --text-secondary: #5F5F5F   (labels, placeholders)
 *   --status-ok:      #2E7D32
 *   --status-warning: #E65100
 *   --status-error:   #C62828
